        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A small rectangular needlepoint picture with upper corners round with a slight semi-circular dip in top;  a landscape with hillocks in foreground, rolling hills in background, cliff at left, two trees in foreground, church and house in background, shepherd wtih three sheep and dog in center, variety of small flowers scattered over hillocks, two birds flying against sky; worked with polychrome silks and wools on wool canvas in fine tent stitch, on double scroll the inscription: MON INOCENCE DE CRAINODOIN TI.  FOULOS IC NE FERRIRIENINOTGNRDE MAT.; bound with coral pink ribbon."@en ;
